ptional).</span></p></li><li><p><span>Serve over rice.</span></p></li></ol></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d6691dc8-6453-4e10-8b77-edac728511ca" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="recipe-wrapper" id="recipe-wrapper" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-sztdqs"><picture data-rid="e7b52efc-5b82-46fa-a369-3a69eab9cb81" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-r8mu6t"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_4.jpg?v=1707590154&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_4.jpg?v=1707590154&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 820px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_4.jpg?v=1707590154&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 821px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_4.jpg?v=1707590154&amp;width=2048" media="(min-width: 1025px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/image_4.jpg?v=1707590154" class="r-1xh6dz4" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="2c029dee-8c51-48aa-974e-7f232665cac1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-g8jf5g"><picture data-rid="d14c4f7e-fb3d-4dc3-bcf5-9fdfd04ee3a8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-3729ub"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg width=&#x27;80&#x27; height=&#x27;16&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 80 16&#x27; fill=&#x27;none&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e %3cpath d=&#x27;M7.42937 1.75623C7.60898 1.20344 8.39102 1.20344 8.57063 1.75623L9.6614 5.11327C9.74173 5.36049 9.9721 5.52786 10.232 5.52786H13.7618C14.3431 5.52786 14.5847 6.27163 14.1145 6.61327L11.2588 8.68804C11.0485 8.84083 10.9606 9.11165 11.0409 9.35886L12.1316 12.7159C12.3113 13.2687 11.6786 13.7284 11.2083 13.3867L8.35267 11.312C8.14238 11.1592 7.85762 11.1592 7.64733 11.312L4.79166 13.